<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt;text-align:left">a reduction in overall cargo volumes reduces the Group&#8217;s revenue and opportunities for growth; in addition, a decline in the volume of cargo shipped due to a downturn in shippers&#8217; business cycles or other factors generally results in decreases in order pricing, as truckers compete for shipping orders to maintain truck productivity, which will affect the Group&#8217;s monetization opportunities; </p></td></tr></table> <p style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
