<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><div style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; line-height: normal;"><div style="font-style: normal; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;"><div style="font-style:italic;display:inline;">Cash and cash equivalents </div></div></div></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Cash and cash equivalents primarily consist of cash on hand and cash in bank which is highly liquid and unrestricted as to withdrawal and use. </div><div style="font-size:18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div></ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:CashAndCashEquivalentsRestrictedCashAndCashEquivalentsPolicy" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025" escape="true" id="ixv-31665">
