<td style="width:4%;vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><div style="letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;"><div style="font-weight:bolder;display:inline;"><div style="font-style:italic;display:inline;">2.6</div></div></div></td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><div style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; line-height: normal;"><div style="font-style: normal; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;"><div style="font-style:italic;display:inline;">Restricted cash </div></div></div></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The Group&#8217;s restricted cash mainly consists of deposit pledged to commercial banks for payment channels, credit solutions and electronic toll collection (&#8220;ETC&#8221;) service. Restricted cash with remaining term over one year is recorded in <div style="white-space: nowrap; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">non-current</div> restricted cash while others is included in current restricted cash. </div><div style="font-size:18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div></ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric name="ymm:ShortTermInvestmentsPolicyTextBlock" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025" escape="true" id="ixv-31679">
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="text-align:start; BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt;border-spacing:0;width:100%">
