al" id="ixv-47401">2,861</ix:nonFraction> and RMB<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentRealizedGainLossOnDisposal" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-3" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-47402">14,814</ix:nonFraction> respectively. </div> <div style="font-size: 6pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;">&#160;</div>
