<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><div style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left; line-height: normal;">Representing the refundable prepayments from shippers and truckers for future shipping arrangements under freight brokerage service and other valued-added service. </div></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric><div style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 8pt;">&#160;</div><div style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:center">F-44 </div></div></div><div style="margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:0em; page-break-before:always"></div><hr style="color:#999999;height:3px;width:100%;clear:both"/><div style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 1.67em; margin-bottom: 1.67em;font-weight: bold;"><div style="font-weight:bolder;display:inline;"><a href="#toc">Table of Contents</a></div></div><div style="width:790px"></div><div style="text-align:center"><div style="width:8.5in;text-align:left;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto"><ix:nonNumeric name="ymm:TemporaryEquityTextBlock" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025" escape="true" id="ixv-36764">
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="text-align:start; BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt;border-spacing:0;width:100%;text-indent: 0px;">
<tr style="page-break-inside:avoid">
<td style="width:4%;vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><div style="letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;"><div style="font-weight:bolder;display:inline;">16.</div></div></td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"><div style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; line-height: normal;">MEZZANINE EQUITY </div></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-indent: 0px;">To develop its cold chain logistics business, the Company established Smart Cold Chain Freight Limited (&#8220;Smart Cold Chain&#8221;) in Cayman Islands. Manyun Cold Chain, a former subsidiary of the Group&#8217;s VIE, becomes a consolidated VIE of Smart Cold Chain through a reorganization under common control whereby the beneficial owners&#8217; interests in Manyun Cold Chain were exchanged into the convertible redeemable preferred shares of Smart Cold Chain at the same percentage in May 2022. </div><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-indent: 0px;">In 2023, Smart Cold Chain issued <ix:nonFraction name="ymm:TemporaryEquityStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_SmartColdChainFreightLimitedMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-47470">7,259,939</ix:nonFraction> convertible redeemable preferred shares to certain investors for the total consideration received amounted to USD<ix:nonFraction name="ymm:RedeemableConvertiblePreferredSharesTotalConsideration" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_SmartColdChainFreightLimitedMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-6" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-47471">16</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, equivalent to RMB<ix:nonFraction name="ymm:RedeemableConvertiblePreferredSharesTotalConsideration" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_SmartColdChainFreightLimitedMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-6" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-47472">112</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million. Concurrently, three other investors agreed and were obliged to subscribe fixed numbers of convertible redeemable preferred shares once they complete the necessary registration for outbound investment. As of December&#160;31, 2023, Smart Cold Chain received RMB<ix:nonFraction name="ymm:PrepaymentProceedsFromIssuanceOfRedeemableConvertiblePreferredStock" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023_AccruedLiabilitiesAndOtherLiabilitiesCurrentMemberusgaapStatementOfFinancialPositionLocationActivityAccrualAxis_RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_SmartColdChainFreightLimitedMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-6" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-47473">90</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million prepayment from such investors which was recorded in accrued expenses and other current liabilities. </div><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-indent: 0px;">In 2024, Smart Cold Chain issued <ix:nonFraction name="ymm:TemporaryEquityStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_SmartColdChainFreightLimitedMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-47474">7,259,939</ix:nonFraction> convertible redeemable preferred shares to certain investors at the same issuance price per share as in 2023. The total consideration received was USD<ix:nonFraction name="ymm:RedeemableConvertiblePreferredSharesTotalConsideration" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_SmartColdChainFreightLimitedMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-6" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-47475">15</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, equivalent to RMB<ix:nonFraction name="ymm:RedeemableConvertiblePreferredSharesTotalConsideration" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_SmartColdChainFreightLimitedMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-6" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-47476">109</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, including RMB<ix:nonFraction name="ymm:PrepaymentProceedsFromIssuanceOfRedeemableConvertiblePreferredStock" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_SmartColdChainFreightLimitedMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-6" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-47477">90</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million prepayment received last year. Concurrently, two other investors agreed and were obliged to subscribe fixed numbers of convertible redeemable preferred shares once they complete the necessary registration for outbound investment. As of December&#160;31, 2024, Smart Cold Chain received RMB<ix:nonFraction name="ymm:PrepaymentProceedsFromIssuanceOfRedeemableConvertiblePreferredStock" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024_AccruedLiabilitiesAndOtherLiabilitiesCurrentMemberusgaapStatementOfFinancialPositionLocationActivityAccrualAxis_RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_SmartColdChainFreightLimitedMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-6" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-47478">100</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million prepayment from such investors which was recorded in accrued expenses and other current liabilities. </div><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-indent: 0px;">In 2025, Smart Cold Chain issued <ix:nonFraction name="ymm:TemporaryEquityStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_SmartColdChainFreightLimitedMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-47479">5,557,608</ix:nonFraction> convertible redeemable preferred shares to certain investors at the same issuance price per share as in 2024. The total consideration received was USD<ix:nonFraction name="ymm:RedeemableConvertiblePreferredSharesTotalConsideration" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_SmartColdChainFreightLimitedMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-6" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-47480">15</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, equivalent to RMB<ix:nonFraction name="ymm:RedeemableConvertiblePreferredSharesTotalConsideration" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_SmartColdChainFreightLimitedMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-6" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-47481">106</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, including RMB<ix:nonFraction name="ymm:PrepaymentProceedsFromIssuanceOfRedeemableConvertiblePreferredStock" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_SmartColdChainFreightLimitedMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-6" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-47482">100</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million prepayment received last year. Concurrently, Smart Cold Chain issued <ix:nonFraction name="ymm:TemporaryEquityStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_PreferredStockMemberusgaapStatementEquityComponentsAxis_RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_SmartColdChainFreightLimitedMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_shares" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-47483">6,495,252</ix:nonFraction> convertible redeemable preferred shares to certain investors for the total consideration received amounted to USD<ix:nonFraction name="ymm:RedeemableConvertiblePreferredSharesTotalConsideration" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_PreferredStockMemberusgaapStatementEquityComponentsAxis_RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_SmartColdChainFreightLimitedMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-6" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-47484">17</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, equivalent to <div style="display:inline;">approximately&#160;</div>RMB<ix:nonFraction name="ymm:RedeemableConvertiblePreferredSharesTotalConsideration" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_PreferredStockMemberusgaapStatementEquityComponentsAxis_RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_SmartColdChainFreightLimitedMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-6" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-47485">121</ix:nonFraction>&#160;<div style="display:inline;"><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">million. For one of these investors, the payment due date for RMB</div></div><ix:nonFraction name="ymm:SubscriptionReceivableFromIssuanceOfRedeemableConvertiblePreferredStock" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_PreferredStockMemberusgaapStatementEquityComponentsAxis_RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_SmartColdChainFreightLimitedMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-6" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-47486">20</ix:nonFraction>&#160;<div style="display:inline;"><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">million of the total consideration was extended. This receivable is recorded in a contra mezzanine equity account as &#8220;subscription receivable.&#8221; Concurrently, one other investor committed to subscribe fixed numbers of convertible redeemable preferred shares upon completing the necessary outbound investment registration procedure. As of December&#160;31, 2025, Smart Cold Chain received RMB</div></div><ix:nonFraction name="ymm:PrepaymentProceedsFromIssuanceOfRedeemableConvertiblePreferredStock" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_AccruedLiabilitiesAndOtherLiabilitiesCurrentMemberusgaapStatementOfFinancialPositionLocationActivityAccrualAxis_RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMemberusgaapStatementClassOfStockAxis_SmartColdChainFreightLimitedMemberdeiLegalEntityAxis" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-6" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-47487">20</ix:nonFraction>&#160;<div style="display:inline;"><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">million prepayment from such investors which has been recorded in accrued expenses and other current liabilities. </div></div></div><div style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-indent: 0px;">The Company uses interest method to accrete the carrying value of the redeemable <div style="white-space: nowrap; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">non-controlling</div> interests to their maximum redemption price as if redemption were to occur at the end of the reporting period. The process of adjusting redeemable <div style="white-space: nowrap; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">non-controlling</div> interests to its redemption value (the &#8220;Mezzanine Adjustment&#8221;) should be performed after attribution of the subsidiary&#8217;s net income or loss pursuant to ASC 810. The carrying amount of redeemable <div style="white-space: nowrap; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">non-controlling</div> interests will equal the higher of the amount resulting from application of ASC 810 or the amount resulting from the Mezzanine Adjustment. The change in the carrying amount of redeemable <div style="white-space: nowrap; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">non-controlling</div> interests is recorded as measurement adjustment attributable to redeemable <div style="white-space: nowrap; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">non-controlling</div> interests in the consolidated statement of operations and comprehensive income. For the years ended December&#160;31, 2023, 2024 and 2025, measurement adjustment attributable to redeemable <div style="white-space: nowrap; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">non-controlling</div> interests at the amount of RMB<ix:nonFraction name="ymm:AdjustmentAttributableToRedeemableNoncontrollingInterests" contextRef="P01_01_2023To12_31_2023" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-3" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-47488">15,457</ix:nonFraction>, RMB<ix:nonFraction name="ymm:AdjustmentAttributableToRedeemableNoncontrollingInterests" contextRef="P01_01_2024To12_31_2024" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-3" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-47489">57,136</ix:nonFraction> and RMB<ix:nonFraction name="ymm:AdjustmentAttributableToRedeemableNoncontrollingInterests" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025" unitRef="Unit_CNY" decimals="-3" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-47490">78,361</ix:nonFraction> were recognized respectively. </div></ix:nonNumeric><div style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 8pt;text-indent: 0px;">&#160;</div><div style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman;text-align:center;text-indent: 0px;">F-45 </div></div></div><div style="margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:0em; page-break-before:always"></div><hr style="color:#999999;height:3px;width:100%;clear:both"/><div style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 1.67em; margin-bottom: 1.67em;font-weight: bold;"><div style="font-weight:bolder;display:inline;"><a href="#toc"